  "tests": "✔ two chained SPI drivers initialize with one OID, controlled enables and matched double-edge mode (1443.115755ms)\nℹ {\"startupMs\":19.559413000000063,\"scope\":\"Two chained TMC2130 drivers with native serialqueue and simulated SPI\"}\n✔ SPI conflicts fail before I/O and all chip selects precede bus activation (422.700596ms)\n✔ failed SPI startup never publishes ready or enables motors (409.834166ms)\n✔ software SPI modern initializes chained drivers without hardware bus commands (419.326144ms)\n✔ software SPI legacy initializes chained drivers without hardware bus commands (416.988825ms)\n✔ software SPI reserves physical pins and rejects mixed chain wiring before I/O (416.59489ms)\n✔ TMC5160 hardware owner supports model current and supply-short monitoring (software=false) (1421.59016ms)\n✔ TMC5160 hardware owner supports model current and supply-short monitoring (software=true) (1413.450341ms)\n✔ TMC2240 SPI owns fixed-range current, temperature and supply-short shutdown (software=false) (2420.544912ms)\n✔ TMC2240 SPI owns fixed-range current, temperature and supply-short shutdown (software=true) (2420.14675ms)\n✔ hardware initializes shared UART drivers with unique OID, disabled motors and matched edge mode (456.205386ms)\nℹ {\"startupMs\":49.72774000000027,\"scope\":\"Two TMC2209 drivers, shared UART, simulated 2ms write completion; includes hardware configuration\"}\n✔ duplicate addresses and peripheral alias collisions are rejected without configuration I/O (412.148097ms)\n✔ failed driver initialization never publishes ready hardware and stops the MCU (408.662773ms)\n✔ runtime driver reset stops configured hardware and cancels all monitor timers (1488.361522ms)\n✔ TMC2240 UART address seven uses model-specific current and monitoring with shared address ownership (2445.986291ms)\n✔ 640 sensorless transitions match original Python field values and register order (26.45499ms)\n✔ ambiguous writes and cancellation at every transition boundary retire ownership (2.36688ms)\n✔ entry and restoration are exclusive and publish state only after final acknowledgement (0.192352ms)\n✔ pre-cancelled entry does no I/O; pre-cancelled restore retires active hardware (0.204822ms)\n✔ invalid model, DIAG and incomplete or corrupt register images fail before I/O (0.219312ms)\n✔ TMC2240 SG4 selects stealthchop and restores thresholds while SG2 selects spreadcycle (0.239053ms)\n✔ startup clears latched GSTAT once; warnings remain visible without stopping (0.455966ms)\n✔ every fatal status bit and runtime reset stop after three confirmations without clearing (1.003482ms)\n✔ startup refuses persistent errors, and stop aborts and joins an in-flight read (0.313054ms)\n✔ TMC2130 status masks, read-cleared GSTAT and active-current reset checks are model-specific (0.656808ms)\n✔ TMC5160 clears startup GSTAT and checks both supply shorts without the 2130 zero-current quirk (0.477446ms)\n✔ cached status preserves unsigned fields, actual quantization, projection and detached snapshots (0.80682ms)\n✔ never-started and normally closed monitors do not advertise current driver telemetry (0.077341ms)\n✔ phase projection uses the current coordinate provider and is hidden after retirement (0.109312ms)\n✔ 4488 original TMC2240 current cases match every register and quantized amp value exactly (14.265158ms)\n✔ range and current limits reject malformed or unsupported electrical settings (0.358974ms)\n✔ live current preserves initialized range and publishes only after both register acknowledgements (0.79145ms)\n✔ partial current update retires owner on write failure (0.237603ms)\n✔ partial current update retires owner on cancellation (0.127772ms)\n✔ all 8192 temperature ADC values match original Python rounded status exactly (2.038336ms)\n✔ 2240 clears startup flags, samples temperature periodically and tolerates temperature-only read errors (0.75838ms)\n✔ 2240 confirms every motor fault and GSTAT bit before stopping without runtime clearing (1.503469ms)\n✔ temperature sampling cancellation is joined and never swallowed as a communication warning (0.323974ms)\n✔ 310 original TMC2240 startup plans preserve register order, values and threshold boundaries (65.570048ms)\n✔ TMC2240 signed waveform offset and model-specific fields reject unsupported values (1.352957ms)\nℹ tests 40\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 40\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 16693.039233\n",
